@startuml
!include ../../_style.puml
skinparam maxMessageSize 240
title Folder settings — mixed selection
actor Teacher
participant "Native module form" as Form
participant "module_form" as Integration
participant "draft_scope" as Scope
participant "draft_import" as Batch
database "Native draft / activity" as Files

Teacher -> Form : Open Settings
Form -> Integration : Module form callbacks
Integration -> Scope : Bind live filemanager and actual limits
Integration --> Form : Native filters and multiple choices
Teacher -> Form : Select files / folders; request review
Form -> Integration : No-submit POST
Integration -> Scope : Review token / profile / selectors
Scope -> Batch : Expand and review authoritative draft contract
Batch -> Files : Read source and destination snapshots
Batch --> Scope : Decisions and digest
Scope --> Form : Remembered approval; rendered review

Teacher -> Form : Add reviewed materials
Form -> Integration : No-submit POST
Integration -> Scope : Check live control and visible selection
Scope -> Batch : Recheck and apply stored approval
Batch -> Files : Transactional draft copies and provenance
Scope --> Form : Rerender native filemanager; retain pending fields

alt Save
  Teacher -> Form : Save and display
  Form -> Files : Native folder update
else Cancel
  Teacher -> Form : Cancel
  note over Form, Files : Saved activity remains unchanged
end
@enduml
